    {
      "id": "975e0ef9-a9fe-43b1-a972-97de2c6bdccf",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase. Relacione a fala a um pedido objetivo de revisão.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "83f1d933-0fb6-4404-825f-44c25533d87f",
          "textContent": "<p>Depois de dizer o problema, o pedido pode vir direto e educado.</p><p><strong>¿Podrían revisarlo, por favor?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Vocês poderiam verificar isso, por favor?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/95a9ad2806744512ab0bb30de566f16d_b05-podrian-revisarlo-por-favor.mp3?Expires=1794099627&Signature=Svnn67qQDq6S4pUczq1EE82JMu1rypEnfodh78XyqPThM1mUP3Og~0U6dbT6umpXUWr5i87D6bcrHgvGp1Z62K4IEqYU0SMHy77HdhDBObszTQs4Qg~n5ULSrREwWro4XP2yLZfFur~HkesmNjiRDJTZjtKMU2guIqvBIJrZ~qfQ9mqrWh-eFUslqIJl1C8-wOBjCID4S7r66yj8j3MAG2juQJc7WrwIil3AoGxRLDWS2N1u0WL8gU3ryIFobK8FskJEZ5LwYfPQ9hJuvO4pzP~W8H0BKUcRtc8S6MdckW9AWJW7Tk1qJMw-8sQMAV8G0v1FuN5Vx1gg3b68cTLuXw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
